==Strategy==
This stage is arguably the same difficulty as [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 3|Floor 3]]. So long as you have ranged attackers like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and a couple of meatshields, this stage shouldn't cause you too much trouble.

